%    The return value is in units of 1e-6 solar masses / year / sr.
%    (The total mass loss rate \code{2 pi int dMdot/dOmega(theta) sin(theta) dtheta}
%     is 2e-6 solar masses / year.)
%\seealso{Friend & Castor (1982), Fig. 4}
%!%-
